{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.Order.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Order.Filter.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.characteristicConvergence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.characteristicConvergence","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QCltNonCommutative.lean#L92-L92","doc":"**Characteristic-function convergence**: pointwise in ξ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.characteristicLimitValue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.characteristicLimitValue","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QCltNonCommutative.lean#L90-L90","doc":"**Characteristic-function limit**: at each ξ, the limit of\nthe characteristic-function sequence. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.characteristicSequence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.characteristicSequence","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QCltNonCommutative.lean#L87-L87","doc":"**Concrete characteristic-function sequence**: for each ξ,\nthe moment-generating-function value `tr_M(exp_q(i ξ · S_n))`\nas a function of `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.momentConvergence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.momentConvergence","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QCltNonCommutative.lean#L80-L80","doc":"**Moment convergence**: for every fixed degree `k`, the\nsequence `n ↦ momentSequence n k` converges to `limitMoment k`.\nEncoded via `Filter.Tendsto`, the standard Mathlib convergence\npredicate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.limitMoment","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.limitMoment","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QCltNonCommutative.lean#L75-L75","doc":"**Limit moments**: the limiting value of the $k$-th moment.\nAlso a class field, so the instance supplies the actual\nlimit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.momentSequence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.momentSequence","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QCltNonCommutative.lean#L71-L71","doc":"**Concrete moment sequence**: for each fixed degree `k`, the\n$k$-th joint moment of the rescaled centred sum `S_n` under\n`tr_M` as a function of `n`. Carrying this as a class field\nforces an instance to supply the actual moment data. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.qGaussianMeasure_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.qGaussianMeasure_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QCltNonCommutative.lean#L66-L66","doc":"The q-Gaussian measure is non-negative at every level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.qGaussianMeasure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.qGaussianMeasure","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QCltNonCommutative.lean#L64-L64","doc":"The q-Gaussian limit measure as a function `level → R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.secondCumulant_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.secondCumulant_pos","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QCltNonCommutative.lean#L62-L62","doc":"Positivity of the limit variance. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.secondCumulant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.secondCumulant","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QCltNonCommutative.lean#L60-L60","doc":"Limit variance (second free q-cumulant). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative.mk","kind":"ctor","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QCltNonCommutative.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.QCltNonCommutative.QCltNonCommutative","kind":"class","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/QCltNonCommutative.lean#L40-L95","doc":"**Conditional q-CLT class.** Asserts the existence of a\nquantitative q-CLT limit for a sequence of Hecke transfer\nmatrices under the Markov trace.\n\nEach field carries content; the class is satisfied only with\nactual mathematical witnesses, not by any pair of propositions.\n\n* `secondCumulant` — the limit variance `κ₂` of `S_n` under\n  `tr_M`.\n* `qGaussianMeasure` — the limit measure `G_q(t, x)` parametrised\n  by a level-index.\n* `momentConvergence` — for each fixed degree `k`, `tr_M(S_n^k)`\n  converges to the `k`-th moment of `qGaussianMeasure`.\n* `characteristicLimit` — the moment-generating-function form of\n  the convergence: `tr_M(exp_q(i ξ S_n))` converges to\n  `exp_q(-ξ²/2 · κ₂)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}